        ex:hasText "Context and objectives  Cabinet Vauclair & Associés is a regional accounting and statutory-audit firm (cabinet d’expertise comptable et de commissariat aux comptes) operating several offices across the Belval region, with around 250 staff (chartered accountants, statutory auditors, accounting, payroll and legal collaborators)." ;
